//! Strata P2P net engine — GENERATED by `ggen sync run` from the
//! `strata-net-pack` ontology. Do not edit by hand.
//!
//! Self-contained (std only, serde-free): CLAP-PDU message framing
//! (8-byte header: magic(4) + kind(1) + payload-len(3, u24 big-endian)),
//! typed decode refusals, a BTreeSet-backed deterministic mempool with
//! lowest-digest-first eviction, and a capacity-capped peer-admission table.
//! Ground truth: packs/strata-protocol-pack/ontology.ttl (CLAP-PDU
//! conventions); mempool admission semantics ride packs/strata-valve-pack.

